      "content": "counselors and \"healing\" just sound like more ways to try and fix something that can't be fixed. it's just more noise. i'm just so tired of fighting against the gravity of how things actually are. it feels like the only real way to find any peace is to just stop existing in this mess. like, if the game is rigged, why stay at the table? it seems like the only logical conclusion is to just... let go.",
